  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "不動產市場研究",
    "sub_ename": "PROPERTY MARKET RESEARCH",
    "describe_ch": "1.藉由研讀調查研究之文獻，協助學生了解市場研究的方法、問卷設計、抽樣方法及執行調查時之問題。\r\n2.協助學生了解目前臺灣不動產市場的研究及實務發展狀況。\r\n\r\n",
    "describe_eh": " 1. To initiate students' discuss about research method, questionnaire design, sampling technique and implementing survey on real estate market.\r\n2. To assist students in understanding the research and empirical status about the real estate market in Taiwan.\r\n\r\n",
